    "title": "Registration for 39th Tour of the Gila begins on New Year's Day - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jordan Honeycutt ,\n1 days ago NEW MEXICO (KRQE) – Organizers are gearing up for the 39th Tour of the Gila. The annual road bike event will be held in the Silver City area on April 29-May 3. Invitations for the main race will be sent soon, but there will also be five races for amateurs, as well as citizen fun races for recreational athletes. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
